<title>SWEDEN: Bofors wins 425 mln SKR order from Swiss army.</title>
<headline>Bofors wins 425 mln SKR order from Swiss army.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Defence contractor Bofors, a unit of Swedish Celsius, on Tuesday said that it had won an order worth 425 million crowns from the Swiss army.  </p>
<p>Bofors said the order was the first from a foreign customer since 1994 for the STRIX anti-armour projectile, which has been in use by the Swedish army.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal has been preceded by comprehensive evaluation which has been supported by Swiss and Swedish military authorities,&quot; Bofors said in a statement.</p>
<p>The STRIX was developed by Bofors and Saab Dynamics , Bofors said.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
